==English==

===Etymology===
From {{af|en|anti-|logarithm}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|mathematics}} The [[number]] of which a given number is the [[logarithm]] (to a given [[base]]).
#: {{ux|en|If ''x'' is the logarithm of ''y'', then ''y'' is the '''antilogarithm''' of ''x''.}}
#: {{syn|en|antilog}}

